{"version":1,"content":"<p>法國巴黎及多個城市上周六（10月31日）繼續有大規模示威，當地民眾連續第三個周末走上街頭抗議生活成本高昂。</p><p>法國內政部表示，示威大致和平進行，參與人數較前兩個周末少，全國共約32萬人上街，其中巴黎約佔7萬人。</p><p>全國逾500人被拘。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:02.854398+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T02:27:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T08:18:09.058470+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.059881+00:00","content_hash":"172b237da1795aa1ab8c9354f4ea70a0c50a86424e82abafdacd49a62fd69b9a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}